This license covers this project's own code: the game (game/, sim/, tools/,
docs/) and the QUASAR-specific firmware glue in firmware/COLDCARD_Q1/modquasar.c
and firmware/python/{main,ui,system,qhw}.py.

The rest of firmware/ — the Coldcard Q board support, the bootloader protocol
client, and the signing tools — is substantially Coinkite Inc.'s own code,
carried over (in several files unmodified, in a few adapted) from their
open-source Coldcard firmware, and remains under their license: MIT with the
Commons Clause restriction on selling the software. See firmware/COPYING-CC
for its exact terms, and the notice at the top of each such file for which
license applies to it.

external/micropython is Coinkite's fork of MicroPython, included as a git
submodule under its own MIT license; see that repository for its license text.
